    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to present to the market this top floor two bedroom / two bathroom apartment in the ever popular Deerpark development in Kiltipper, Dublin 24.\n\nPerfectly suited for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors, this well-maintained property offers a blend of comfort and convenience in a peaceful suburban setting. The internal living accommodation spans 63 sq m approx. Briefly comprises of entrance hall, two bedrooms, family bathroom and kitchen/living area. This property benefits from a quiet setting with easy access to local amenities including shops, restaurants and parks.\n\nThe nearby LUAS line and excellent bus service provide swift access to Dublin City Centre, making it an ideal location for commuters. \n\nNo 46 offers a low maintenance and hassle free living experience. Whether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing or seeking a sound investment, this property is an excellent choice.\n\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, please get in touch via phone or email."
      },
